    "details": "<p><strong>Join the official group for information and updates: <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/LQQ76cEkFN2DppeGkXWHb3\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/LQQ76cEkFN2DppeGkXWHb3</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>About:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Top three teams:</strong> Paid internship opportunities</li>\n<li><strong>Top three teams Prize Pool:</strong> 30,000 Rs</li>\n<li><strong>Every participant:</strong> One complimentary .xyz domain</li>\n<li><strong>Every participant:</strong> $100 in Inkloom AI credits, 500$ Adaption AI credits, 100$ ASI Credits</li>\n<li><strong>Every eligible participant:</strong> Verifiable digital certificate</li>\n<li><strong>Rewards:</strong> 100+ recipients across the hackathon</li>\n<li><strong>No. of Rounds:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Hackathon Dates:</strong> 17 December &ndash; 27 December 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Mode:</strong> Completely online</li>\n<li><strong>Team size:</strong> 1&ndash;6 members</li>\n<li><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> Free</li>\n<li><strong>Tracks:</strong> Agentic AI, Full-Stack Product Engineering</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Join the official WhatsApp group for participation details, announcements and important hackathon updates.</p>\n<p>A participant must complete the hackathon and make a valid final submission to receive a verifiable digital certificate. Registration alone will not qualify a participant for a certificate.</p>\n<p>PPOs and partner benefits are subject to eligibility requirements, availability and the respective partner&rsquo;s selection process.<br /><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Rules</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants must submit original work within the deadline and follow all event guidelines.</li>\n<li>Plagiarism, false information or multiple submissions may result in disqualification.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to students, developers, designers and technology enthusiasts across India.</li>\n<li>Participants may join individually or form a team according to the event&rsquo;s permitted team size.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Process</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Register for the event, join the official communication group and complete every announced round.</li>\n<li>Qualified participants will receive the instructions and submission details for the next stage.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"blue_un-border-before comp-detail un_editor_text_live expanded\">\n<p><em><strong>Note: Teams selected for Round 3 pay a participation fee of ₹399 per team &mdash; one payment for the whole team, not one each. The fee covers the cost of running the event: infrastructure, the time and effort of organising it, and paying the people who do that work. Registering and Rounds 1 and 2 are free, and this is the only payment anywhere in this event. It falls due only once your team is selected for Round 3, so a team that is not selected pays nothing at all.</strong></em></p>\n</div>",
